<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which holds</i>; and so,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>hindrance, impediment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.259
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
			gen., <i>bulwark, defence against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηλυσίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.201
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>holdfast, stay</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχματα πέτρης</span>
			<i>the grip</i> of the rock (viz. the river-bed), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.139
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχματα πύργων</span>
			<i>buttresses</i> of the fortifications, <i><span class="en">
				12.260
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχματα νηῶν</span>
			<i>props</i> or <i>cradles</i> for the ships, <i><span class="en">
				14.410
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχματα γαίης</span>, of the
			earth which <i>holds fast</i> the roots of a tree, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1200
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχματα γούνων</span>, of
			muscles, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				724
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχμός</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1411.24
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
